{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NFp7KkgXxZPgZhCz6xdbJ7","type":"tool_result","content":"16:`correct` (validity only; claim assessment is the separate claim_status_code) = integrity AND exact one-sided binomial coverage tests (pooled level 0.01, per family\n17:Bonferroni 0.01/5, failed episodes are misses) AND all controls pass their declared behaviour.\n93:MAIN_LEVEL = 0.01\n94:CONTROL_LEVEL = 0.01 / 3\n788:def binom_cdf(k, n, p):\n789:    from scipy.stats import binom\n790:    return float(binom.cdf(k, n, p))\n797:    return binom_cdf(int(sum(covered)), n, NOMINAL) >= level\n890:BOOTSTRAP_REPLICATES = 2000\n894:    \"\"\"Paired episode-level bootstrap (within family) 2.5th percentile of combined_score.\"\"\"\n896:    total = np.zeros(BOOTSTRAP_REPLICATES)\n901:        idx = rng.integers(0, len(eps), (BOOTSTRAP_REPLICATES, len(eps)))\n909:    \"\"\"claim_status_code: 0 invalid, 1 no-gain-or-worse, 2 narrower with valid coverage.\"\"\"\n912:    metrics[\"claim_status_code\"] = 0 if not correct else (2 if lower > 1e-9 else 1)\nlabel_free_basis_metrics.json\nrecalibrated_metrics.json\nstacked_metrics.json\n{\n \"real\": {\n  \"census_income\": {\n   \"var_y\": 5757964448.773105,\n   \"var_yhat\": 1123637530.0001683,\n   \"cov\": 1545231131.683122,\n   \"rho2\": 0.3690555009090044,\n   \"eta2_iso\": 0.3734383354961102,\n   \"eta2_bin\": 0.37233402799925885,\n   \"pool_size\": 380091,\n   \"n_unique_yhat\": 270228,\n   \"lambda_star_ppi_pp\": 1.0,\n   \"lambda_unclipped\": 1.341662704605019,\n   \"oracle_vs_ppi_pp\": 0.02127041713592697,\n   \"oracle_linear_vs_ppi_pp\": 0.017918348040698872,\n   \"oracle_vs_ppi_lam1\": 0.02127041713592697,\n   \"oracle_vs_classical\": 0.22653792472114917,\n   \"ppi_pp_vs_classical\": 0.2052675075852222,\n   \"ppi_pp_vs_ppi_lam1\": -0.0\n  },\n  \"census_healthcare\": {\n   \"var_y\": 0.22080762810115145,\n   \"var_yhat\": 0.1136831142888488,\n   \"cov\": 0.11198648893535212,\n   \"rho2\": 0.4995